    "Loose writing slips bound together into a rolled or bundled book.",
    "Oracle shows many uneven vertical slips tied across the middle by horizontal bindings.",
    "Regular simplified 册 reduces the number of visible slips and replaces the binding with a diagonal crossing stroke; Traditional 冊 keeps the fuller bound-slip structure."
  ],
